---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-profile">
      <img
        src="https://www.gravatar.com/avatar/badc07a7a13053f553c78bfae21f6556?s=120"
        alt="Shwetank Tewari"
        width="120"
        height="120"
        class="about-avatar"
      />
      <h1>About Me</h1>
    </div>
    <p>Hi, I am Shwetank - Full Stack Engineer bHsed in Port Jefferson, New York. Here I share my thoughts on software engineering, programming, and things I learn along the way.</p>
    <p>Before transitioning into tech, I worked as a Social Science researcher. That experience taught me that humans (including you and me) are far more complex than the academic theories we use to discuss these ideas.</p>
    <p>Apart from programming, I enjoy reading poetry and short stories. Dickinson and Chekhov are my current favorites.</p>
    <p>If something here resonates with you, feel free to leave a comment. I am always open to interesting conversations around tech and ideas.</p>

    <hr class="about-me-hr" />
    <h2>AI Use Disclosure</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>For programming, I use AI agent primarily to exchange ideas. I believe that modern AI tools are just that - tools. Programmers are responsible for every single line of code that they write, using whatever tools they are comfortable with.</li>
      <li>
        For writing, I use AI for light editing to remove grammar issues and improve fluency.
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>